{"title":"The Genius Grandson of Namgung Clan","synopsis":"Bencana melanda Ha Hyeon yang berusia sepuluh tahun, memusnahkan seluruh klannya. Setelah kehilangan segalanya—rumah tangga dan keluarganya—dia nyaris tidak bertahan hidup dan tiba di keluarga Namgung. Di sana, dia berkata kepada kakek dari pihak ibunya, ‘Sword Saint’ Namgung Muryong: “Aku tidak ingin kehilangan apa pun yang berharga lagi.” Melihat tekad Ha Hyeon untuk berjalan di jalan yang benar meskipun situasinya putus asa, Namgung Muryong mengirimnya ke ujian masuk. Di sana, Ha Hyeon mulai menonjol dengan prestasinya yang luar biasa, mempelajari dan memanfaatkan seni bela diri yang belum pernah diajarkan kepadanya hanya dengan mengamati. Keajaiban yang dikirim surga ‘Ha Hyeon’ memulai jalan yang benar untuk menjadi yang terhebat.","alternative_title":"The Grandchild of Namgung Clan Is a Prodigy, 남궁세가 천재 외손자","author":"Seonkkeom, Sinlang","artist":"Yoo Hyeong-Seok","genres":["Action","Fantasy","Historical","Martial Arts"],"chapters":[{"id":"fc279740-09ec-476c-8347-a25eec7c40ff","number":"89","title":"Chapter 89","date":"2026-08-01","images":[]},{"id":"c7255ee9-583e-4c7b-8e51-9dd97102a49b","number":"88","title":"Chapter 88","date":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"id":"4873af1f-d452-49c7-b53e-1281a00e407d","number":"87","title":"Chapter 87","date":"2026-07-11","images":[]},{"id":"fc023040-aefb-42f0-a55e-6ca9f50a6827","number":"86","title":"Chapter 86","date":"2026-07-11","images":[]},{"id":"1b3a7fbf-3d7e-426f-aa09-13206aea9084","number":"85","title":"Chapter 85","date":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"id":"238455b6-84fb-4607-a603-0f4a0e0bb5ad","number":"84","title":"Chapter 84","date":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"id":"b50ae1b6-e2a0-461c-94b9-a659466f7306","number":"83","title":"Chapter 83","date":"2026-05-30","images":[]},{"id":"68e896f7-b6b3-4752-aa9d-beeaaf6ee356","number":"82","title":"Chapter 82","date":"2026-05-19","images":[]},{"id":"53468dd6-30f0-4932-b0fd-4f825dbbdfa9","number":"81","title":"Chapter 81","date